  'Capillary' => 'The smallest blood vessel, connecting arterioles and venules, where oxygen, carbon dioxide, nutrients, hormones, and waste products exchange with tissues.',
  'Capillary Leak Syndrome' => 'A condition in which plasma escapes from capillaries into surrounding tissues, causing swelling, low blood pressure, hemoconcentration, and potentially shock; it may be systemic or secondary to severe illness or treatment.',
  'Capillary Refill' => 'The return of normal color to a blanched nail bed or skin after pressure is released, used as a quick but limited bedside indicator of peripheral perfusion.',
  'Capitate' => 'The largest carpal bone, centrally located in the wrist and articulating with the third metacarpal, scaphoid, lunate, hamate, and neighboring carpals.',
